<title>JAPAN: Tokyu Department -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyu Department -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	   160.35		vs	  158.55</p>
<p> Operating	    3.68		vs	    2.60</p>
<p> Current		2.19		vs	    2.01</p>
<p> Net		  931    million	  vs	  930    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.37 yen	  vs	    3.37 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    277 million	  vs	 276 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyu Department Store Co Ltd heads the Tokyu group&quot;s retail/distribution division.</p>
</text>
